{"id":"0632c91c845f3662","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-tripos.md","title":"Sets 上的 tripos","display":"df-tripos — Sets 上的 tripos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-tripos","aliases":["16-df-tripos","Tripos"],"display":"df-tripos — Sets 上的 tripos","depends_on":["[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]","[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"Definition 5.3.3, p. 332 (PDF 352)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-tripos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-tripos</span><span>Tripos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tripos — Sets 上的 tripos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ae5978eb27da451\" href=\"?note=6ae5978eb27da451\" title=\"16-df-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-higher-order-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 5.3.3, p. 332 (PDF 352)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为纤维化，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>高阶结构及任意集合函数的量词换基见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6ae5978eb27da451\" href=\"?note=6ae5978eb27da451\" title=\"16-df-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-higher-order-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{HOFib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6ae5978eb27da451\" href=\"?note=6ae5978eb27da451\" title=\"16-df-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-higher-order-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tripos}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tripos}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tripos}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{BC}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tripos}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{BC}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 Jacobs Definition 5.3.3：Sets 上的高阶纤维化，且存在量词、全称量词满足任意拉回的 Beck–Chevalley。</li>\n<li><code>BC</code> 在此包括一般量词的存在。保持联结词已包含在一阶纤维化中；泛性使用唯一分类箭头的书中版本。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 5.3.3, p. 332 (PDF 352)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6ae5978eb27da451","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$，$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为纤维化，见 [[16-df-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6ae5978eb27da451","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"高阶结构及任意集合函数的量词换基见 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"高阶结构及任意集合函数的量词换基见 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6ae5978eb27da451","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HOFib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tripos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tripos}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{BC}(p).","display":true}],"bytes":1421,"backlinks":[{"id":"3e07004160abc932","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)$，分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]] 与 [[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。两种结构均蕴含 $\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$；$\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 使用 [[16-df-set-of-fibration]] 的同一完整关系商范畴构造。"},{"id":"47227c67c957016e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tripos}$ 采用 [[16-df-tripos]]；$\\mathrm{Tripos}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-367","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-tripos|df-tripos — Sets 上的 tripos]]"},{"id":"55e5037ed821c800","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tripos}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。"}],"outgoing":["6ae5978eb27da451","86e53aa076639692","09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}